</span></div></div></a></div></section><section id="parking-and-transportation" data-analytics-section="parking-transportation" class="mbs-promo--container"><div class="mbs-promo-image--container"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/64b046e49989ad9d70043c7e_parking-map.avif" alt="Mercedes-Benz Stadium parking lot map from overhead showing a diagram of each available lot for event days" sizes="(max-width: 1095px) 100vw, 1095px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/64b046e49989ad9d70043c7e_parking-map-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/64b046e49989ad9d70043c7e_parking-map-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/64b046e49989ad9d70043c7e_parking-map-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/64b046e49989ad9d70043c7e_parking-map.avif 1095w" class="mbs-promo-image"/></div><div class="mbs-promo-copy--container"><h2 class="mbs-promo-heading--primary">Parking and Transportation</h2><p class="mbs-promo-copy--paragraph">Plan ahead with a variety of parking options for games and events at Mercedes-Benz Stadium. There are more than 20,000 parking spots available within a 20-minute walk of the stadium. Pre-purchasing your pass is highly recommended as all parking will often sell out prior to an event.</p><div class="mbs-pt--options"><a href="http://parking.mercedesbenzstadium.com/events" target="_blank" class="comp__parking_content_btn w-inline-block"><div class="comp__parking_content_btn_icon"></div><div>Purchase Parking</div></a><a href="https://itsmarta.com/" target="_blank" class="comp__parking_content_btn w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/67b786b491f2665db9b929db_marta.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/67b786b491f2665db9b929db_marta-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/67b786b491f2665db9b929db_marta-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/67b786b491f2665db9b929db_marta.webp 3200w" alt="MARTA logo" class="marta-icon"/><div>MARTA Information</div></a><a href="https://parking.mercedesbenzstadium.com/lot-info" target="_blank" class="comp__parking_content_btn w-inline-block"><div class="comp__parking_content_btn_icon"></div><div>Lot Information</div></a><a href="/visit/parking-tailgate-guidelines" class="comp__parking_content_btn w-inline-block"><div class="comp__parking_content_btn_icon"></div><div>Rules<br/>&amp; Policies</div></a></div></div></section><section class="home_news--wrapper"><h2 class="home_news_h">Stadium News</h2><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="home_news--list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="home_news--item w-dyn-item"><img alt="Global superstars Stray Kids today announced their highly anticipated 2027 World Tour ‘RUN IT’" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6af22bc244a3c2b06ef6afd8_Static_Outdoor-ConcertVision_1920x1080_StrayKids_2027_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium_0608.jpg" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6af22bc244a3c2b06ef6afd8_Static_Outdoor-ConcertVision_1920x1080_StrayKids_2027_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium_0608-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6af22bc244a3c2b06ef6afd8_Static_Outdoor-ConcertVision_1920x1080_StrayKids_2027_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium_0608-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6af22bc244a3c2b06ef6afd8_Static_Outdoor-ConcertVision_1920x1080_StrayKids_2027_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium_0608-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6af22bc244a3c2b06ef6afd8_Static_Outdoor-ConcertVision_1920x1080_StrayKids_2027_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium_0608-p-1600.jpg 1