</style></div><div>August 19, 2026</div><div class="btn--wrapper"><a href="/news/mercedes-benz-stadium-voted-best-nfl-stadium-and-best-stadium-food-in-usa-today-10best-readers-choice-awards" class="btn--1 w-inline-block"><div>Read More</div></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="home_news--item w-dyn-item"><img alt="Record FIFTH Show Added For The R&amp;B Tour In Atlanta" loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6a825fdb23ca7a92f48eaf53_1920x1080_TheRAndBTour_2026_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium.jpg" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6a825fdb23ca7a92f48eaf53_1920x1080_TheRAndBTour_2026_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6a825fdb23ca7a92f48eaf53_1920x1080_TheRAndBTour_2026_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6a825fdb23ca7a92f48eaf53_1920x1080_TheRAndBTour_2026_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6a825fdb23ca7a92f48eaf53_1920x1080_TheRAndBTour_2026_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedd0e3047ab406ee3c37e/6a825fdb23ca7a92f48eaf53_1920x1080_TheRAndBTour_2026_Regional_Mercedes-BenzStadium.jpg 1920w" class="home_news_img"/><div class="home_news_content"><h3 class="home_news_title">Record FIFTH Show Added For The R&amp;B Tour In Atlanta</h3><div class="w-embed"><style>
	.home_news_title {
  	display: -webkit-box;
  	-webkit-line-clamp: 2;
  	-webkit-box-orient: vertical;  
  	overflow: hidden;
	}
</style></div><div>August 17, 2026</div><div class="btn--wrapper"><a href="/news/record-fifth-show-added-for-the-r-b-tour-in-atlanta" class="btn--1 w-inline-block"><div>Read More</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="main--wrapper"><div class="comp__guidelines"><h2>Fan Guidelines</h2><div class="comp__guidelines--grid"><div id="w-node-b666a3e2-cfdb-218a-88d9-e0c0297e176c-297e1767" class="comp__guidelines--item"><div class="comp__guidelines_icon"></div><h3>Accessibility</h3><p>From accessible parking to accommodative seating, Mercedes-Benz Stadium offers a host of ADA Services. We also provide wheelchair and companion seating on all levels. For more information, <a href="/accessibility">please visit this page</a>.</p></div><div id="w-node-b666a3e2-cfdb-218a-88d9-e0c0297e1777-297e1767" class="comp__guidelines--item"><div class="comp__guidelines_icon"></div><h3>Health and Safety</h3><p>Emergency services are available on site at all times by texting <a href="sms://4704440234;?&amp;body=HELP">(470) 444-0234</a>. We take cleaning and disinfection to the next level. All &quot;high touch&quot; surfaces in stadium common areas are cleaned before, during, and after each event.</p></div><div id="w-node-b666a3e2-cfdb-218a-88d9-e0c0297e1785-297e1767" class="comp__guidelines--item"><div class="comp__guidelines_icon"></div><h3>Bag Policy</h3><p>For quickest entry into the stadium, we strongly recommend that you do not bring a bag on event day. If a bag is necessary, the bag must meet the specific criteria in order to enter the stadium</p></div></div><div class="comp__fb_content fan-guidelines__sub-container"><p class="txt--c">Learn more about our Fan Guidelines, detailing accessibility services and stadium policies for an informed and hassle-free visit. All fans are expected to adhere to the Fan Code of Conduct while inside the stadium and on the surrounding property.</p><div class="btn--wrapper center"><a href="https://www.mercedesbenzstadium.com/guidelines" class="btn--1 w-inline-block"><div>View Guidelines</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="home_founders--wrapper"><div class="home_founders"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/6556ca3ea46b669e42b14510_logo-college-football-national-championship-2-125x125.png" loading="lazy" id="w-node-aa61cfe9-d97d-0355-0713-d612647cfbe3-8b4e84fa" alt="College Football Playoff National Championship logo" class="home_founders_img"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/65bbf372b2d88c564ccd9db1_fwc2026_hcl_la_atl_4ct_l.jpg" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_7f1069c9-39ea-9149-eee9-85a00202fd71-8b4e84fa" sizes="100vw" alt="FIFA World Cup 26 Atlanta logo with the World Cup trophy" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/65bbf372b2d88c564ccd9db1_fwc2026_hcl_la_atl_4ct_l-p-500.jpg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/65bbf372b2d88c564ccd9db1_fwc2026_hcl_la_atl_4ct_l-p-800.jpg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/65bbf372b2d88c564ccd9db1_fwc2026_hcl_la_atl_4ct_l-p-1080.jpg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/65bbf372b2d88c564ccd9db1_fwc2026_hcl_la_atl_4ct_l-p-1600.jpg 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/65bbf372b2d88c564ccd9db1_fwc2026_hcl_la_atl_4ct_l-p-2000.jpg 2000w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/65bbf372b2d88c564ccd9db1_fwc2026_hcl_la_atl_4ct_l-p-2600.jpg 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/65bbf372b2d88c564ccd9db1_fwc2026_hcl_la_atl_4ct_l.jpg 2866w" class="home_founders_img"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/6556ca3e0e8614e615ebe2c1_logo-sec-championship-2-125x125.png" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_4dd1a946-9a93-667a-6f5c-33203fee6f3b-8b4e84fa" alt="SEC Championship Game logo" class="home_founders_img"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/6556ca3ec105a41efc4c8e97_SBLIII-copy-5-125x125.avif" loading="lazy" id="w-node-d0c36ded-e275-ebf7-62e6-3192c15b3d9c-8b4e84fa" alt="Super Bowl LIII logo" class="home_founders_img"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/6556ca3e93a5667c7cba772c_logo-falcons-2-125x125.avif" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_2648c1d7-0ba2-6deb-b2f2-751ccd21c7d9-8b4e84fa" alt="Atlanta Falcons logo" class="home_founders_img"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/6556ca3e608be2e45b8cd9a2_AU_Primary_PMS-125x125.avif" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_48ab0f0b-207e-d631-fcca-aabe762f810e-8b4e84fa" alt="Atlanta United logo" class="home_founders_img"/><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/6ae8c02d9afd4c464b04bc3f_ATLCTY_Gradient-Crest_RGB.svg" loading="lazy" id="w-node-_9459ca62-8f1a-4e00-6d75-4d733a0bd247-8b4e84fa" alt="Atlanta City FC logo featuring a stylized phoenix with open wings in orange gradient inside a red circular badge with white text reading ATLANTA at the top and CITY FC at the bottom." class="home_founders_img"/></div></div></div><footer class="footer--wrapper"><div class="footer_logo"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/64b177246672892a7f93998d_mbs_logo__color_ow.avif" loading="lazy" alt="Mercedes-Benz Stadium logomark" class="footer_logo--img"/><div class="footer_logo_divider"></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/5ddedb3aabcf2c01a3f45461/6903a0190cf1134c3d238e93_MB-star_p_2D_3Cweb.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Mercedes-Benz star logo" class="footer_logo--img footer_logo--benz-img"/></div><div class="footer_copyright w-embed w-script"><p style="text-align: center"> Copyright &copy; 2017-<script>document.write(new Date().getFullYear())</script> Mercedes-Benz Stadium. All Rights Reserved.</p></div><div class="footer_sites"><a href="https://blankfamilyofbusinesses.com/" target="_blank" class="footer_sites_link">Blank Family of BusinessES</a><a href="https://w